#### Step B: The Sync Engine
This function runs whenever the device detects a network change.

```javascript
async function syncData() {
  const pendingRecords = await db.execute("SELECT * FROM surveys WHERE sync_status = 'pending'");

  for (const record of pendingRecords) {
    try {
      const response = await fetch('https://api.yoursurvey.com/submit', {
        method: 'POST',
        body: JSON.stringify(record),
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' }
