### 5. Automatic Sync Strategy
Use a `useEffect` in your root component to listen for connectivity changes.

```javascript
useEffect(() => {
  const unsubscribe = NetInfo.addEventListener(state => {
    if (state.isConnected) {
      syncPendingSurveys(); // Trigger background sync
    }
  });
  return () => unsubscribe();
}, []);
```

