2.  **[D3-dsv](https://github.com/d3/d3-dsv):** For handling high-speed CSV/JSON streaming from your backend.
3.  **[React-Spring](https://www.react-spring.dev/):** If using React, use this to animate the transitions between price changes smoothly.

