### 2. The Real-time Backend (Firebase)
Create a file `firebase.js`. You’ll need a Firebase project from [console.firebase.google.com](https://console.firebase.google.com/).

```javascript
import { initializeApp } from "firebase/app";
import { getDatabase } from "firebase/database";

