### 3. How to make it "Real-Time"
To achieve collaboration, you need a **Pub/Sub** mechanism. Here is the architecture you should implement:

#### A. Backend (Node.js + Socket.io)
When a user drops a card, the client sends an event to the server. The server then broadcasts that event to all other connected clients.

```javascript
// Server-side snippet
io.on('connection', (socket) => {
  socket.on('task-moved', (data) => {
    // Broadcast to everyone else
    socket.broadcast.emit('update-board', data);
  });
});
```

#### B. Frontend Integration
Update your `app.js` to listen for these updates:

```javascript
