To move from this "Minimal Version" to a production-grade system, implement these four pillars:

#### A. Deterministic Execution (The Disruptor Pattern)
Do not use mutexes. Mutexes cause the OS to put threads to sleep, adding milliseconds of latency. Instead, use **Ring Buffers** (SPSC - Single Producer Single Consumer queues). One thread writes, one thread reads.

