If you are building this for HFT (High-Frequency Trading) or high-speed telemetry, code logic is only half the battle. You must tune the hardware:

#### 1. CPU Isolation (`isolcpus`)
Prevent the Linux kernel from scheduling any tasks on the cores running your DPDK application.
*   Edit `/etc/default/grub`: `GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX_DEFAULT="... isolcpus=1,2,3"`

#### 2. Hugepages
